-### Parameters
-*   **Precomputed Values**: 9 floating-point values ($n_i^x, n_i^y, d_i^{xy}$ for $i=0,1,2$) per triangle [S1].
-*   **Plane Equation**: 3 coefficients, normalized by the dominant axis [S1].
